<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SupportPhPortal | 薬剤師と患者さんをつなぐ支援の入り口</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS for utility-first styling -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Noto Sans JP for a clean, friendly look -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Lucide Icons for consistent iconography -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
            background-color: #fdfcf8; /* 温かみのあるオフホワイト */
            color: #4a4a4a; /* 柔らかなダークグレー */
        }
        .accent-color {
            color: #e67e22; /* テラコッタ・オレンジ */
        }
        .accent-bg {
            background-color: #e67e22;
        }
        .border-warm {
            border-color: #f0ede4;
        }
        /* ふんわりとした浮き上がりアニメーション */
        .fade-in {
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-out forwards;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-column items-center justify-center">

    <div class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 flex flex-col items-center">
        <!-- Main Logo / Title Section -->
        <div class="fade-in text-center">
            <div class="accent-bg w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white mx-auto mb-8 shadow-lg shadow-orange-200">
                <i data-lucide="heart-handshake" class="w-8 h-8"></i>
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight accent-color mb-2">
                SupportPhPortal
            </h1>
            
            <p class="text-gray-400 font-light text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-12">
                Empowering Pharmacists, Supporting Patients
            </p>

            <div class="h-px w-12 bg-orange-200 mx-auto mb-12"></div>

            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-light mb-8 leading-tight">
                保険薬局薬剤師の<span class="font-bold accent-color">業務を助け</span>、<br>
                患者さんの<span class="font-bold accent-color">支援を支える</span>。
            </h2>
            
            <p class="text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-16 px-4">
                日々の多忙な業務をシンプルに整理し、薬剤師がもっと「患者さんの声」に耳を傾けられる時間を創り出したい。<br class="hidden md:block">
                SupportPhPortalは、あなたの専門性を最大限に引き出すためのパートナーです。
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Tool Gateway Area (Future placeholders with context) -->
        <div class="fade-in w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-3xl" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
            <div class="bg-white/60 border border-warm rounded-3xl p-8 flex items-start gap-5">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-orange-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                    <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" class="accent-color w-6 h-6"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1 text-lg">業務の効率化</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">計算や判定などのルーチンを自動化し、ミスを防ぎます。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/60 border border-warm rounded-3xl p-8 flex items-start gap-5">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-orange-50 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                    <i data-lucide="users" class="accent-color w-6 h-6"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1 text-lg">患者支援の質を向上</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">根拠に基づいた指導を支援し、対人業務をアップデートします。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- GitHub Link Footer -->
        <footer class="fade-in mt-24 text-center" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
            <a href="https://github.com/589ph/SupportPhPortal" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-400 hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors text-sm">
                <i data-lucide="github" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                <span>github.com/589ph/SupportPhPortal</span>
            </a>
            <p class="mt-8 text-[10px] text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">
                &copy; 2026 SupportPhPortal
            </p>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Lucideアイコンの初期化
        lucide.createIcons();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
